OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident at NHS trust
OL,4,Astood down
OL,5,
OL,6,FA critical incident declared over
OL,7,F"extreme pressure" at an NHS trust in
OL,8,FNottingham has been stood down.
OL,10,FNottingham University Hospitals (NUH)
OL,11,FNHS trust - which runs the Queen's
OL,12,FMedical Centre and Nottingham City
OL,13,FHospital - announced the critical
OL,14,Fincident on Tuesday, citing record
OL,15,Fnumbers of patients in its emergency
OL,16,Fdepartments.
OL,18,FIt marks the fourth critical incident
OL,19,Fdeclared by the trust this year, with
OL,20,Fprevious critical incidents in January,
OL,21,FFebruary and June.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
