OL,3,GNEWSACritical incident at NHS trust
OL,4,Astood down
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Wednesday, the trust confirmed the
OL,7,Fincident was stood down at 13:30 BST
OL,8,Fafter meeting the necessary criteria.
